+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+Measured on a 5,000-record store, the `SessionStart` health gate had a p50
+latency of **11.9 ms** before `quick_check` was removed from the read path. After
+that change, with the `fts_rows` counter and the body `CHECK` added at the same
+time, the measured p50 was **1.05 ms**.
+
+These measurements compare the complete before and after states. Because the
+three changes landed together, they do not isolate how much of the reduction is
+attributable to any one change.
